package Pkg
public
with Other;
end Pkg;

natural_language_semantics.syntax_semantics:
三种形式：
1. defining_identifier renames package package_name ;
2. [defining_identifier] renames component_category unique_component_type_reference ;
3. renames package_name::all ;（导入包中所有公共元素）

basics.bnf_syntax:
mode ::=
    defining_mode_identifier : [ initial ] mode 
    [ { { mode_property_associ ation }+ } ];

valid_examples.code:
